      "publishedDate": "2026-09-13T00:45:17.567Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-09-13T00:45:17.567Z",
      "description": "A security flaw has been discovered in lenve vhr 1.0-SNAPSHOT. This issue affects some unknown processing of the component MailReceiver. Performing a manipulation results in deserialization. The attack is possible to be carried out remotely. The exploit has been released to the public and may be used for attacks. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.",
      "severity": 6.3,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：lenve vhr\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
